{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTY2OTQ4","is_bot":false,"login":"corelix","name":"Dmytro Pylypenko"},"body":"##  Request\n\nWe would like an official **Temporal integration for the OpenAI Agents SDK in JavaScript/TypeScript**, analogous to the existing `OpenAIAgentsPlugin` for the Python SDK.\n\n###  Background\n\nTemporal + OpenAI Agents SDK (Python) released an integration that enables:\n\n- Durable state persistence  \n- Fault recovery and retry logic  \n- Observability (tracing / audit trails)  \n- Scalable agent execution  \n- Cost saving by avoiding redundant LLM calls \n\nIn the Python ecosystem, developers can simply plug in `OpenAIAgentsPlugin` to enable agent orchestration inside Temporal workflows.\n\n### ❓ Is this on your roadmap?\n\nDoes the Temporal team plan to release official support for **openai-agents-js**? If so—do you have an ETA or early preview we could try?","closedAt":null,"comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOEujx1867OAxa","author":{"login":"mjameswh"},"authorAssociation":"MEMBER","body":"Thanks for asking.\n\nThis is indeed on our roadmap, but I unfortunately don't have an ETA I can share at the moment.","createdAt":"2025-07-31T18:51:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":4}},{"content":"ROCKET","users":{"totalCount":16}},{"content":"EYES","users":{"totalCount":6}}],"url":"https://github.com/temporalio/sdk-typescript/issues/1755#issuecomment-3141012570","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOEujx187A1iC4","author":{"login":"syuan100"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"+1 on this!","createdAt":"2025-08-28T23:33:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/temporalio/sdk-typescript/issues/1755#issuecomment-3235258552","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOEujx187EBXu7","author":{"login":"bruno-schema52"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"+1 on this!","createdAt":"2025-09-13T18:07:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/temporalio/sdk-typescript/issues/1755#issuecomment-3288693691","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOEujx187Fifn5","author":{"login":"Maximgitman"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Looking forward for this integration","createdAt":"2025-09-19T23:18:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/temporalio/sdk-typescript/issues/1755#issuecomment-3314153977","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOEujx187Td5Tu","author":{"login":"fernando-playplay"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Looking forward for this integration here as well","createdAt":"2025-11-18T14:16:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/temporalio/sdk-typescript/issues/1755#issuecomment-3547829486","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOEujx187Wyxcy","author":{"login":"marc-wilson"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@mjameswh has there been any new updates around an ETA?","createdAt":"2025-12-02T19:26:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/temporalio/sdk-typescript/issues/1755#issuecomment-3603633970","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOEujx187WzYF7","author":{"login":"mjameswh"},"authorAssociation":"MEMBER","body":"The first AI agents library we're integrating with in TS is [ai](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai). The [PR](https://github.com/temporalio/sdk-typescript/pull/1792) is in review, so it should hopefully land soon.\n\nI really don't have an ETA or even the relative prioritization for any other s